<.layout_page_centered>
  <!-- Project header -->
  <.container_page_heading
    title="Burohelp"
    description="Circular Giving made easy"
  />
  <!-- Brand hero image -->
  <.container_hero_image image="/images/cases/burohelp_home.png" />
  <!-- About project -->
  <.container_page_text title="The Company">
    <.container_page_paragraph>
      Burohelp is an ANBI non-profit organisation registered in the Netherlands that operates a marketplace that connect non-profits with commercial organisations.
    </.container_page_paragraph>
    <.container_page_paragraph>
      Non-profits continously import the timesheets from their ongoing projects in the Burohelp timebank. Commercial organisations donate money (as operational donations) for specific projects and chunks of hours worked.
    </.container_page_paragraph>
    <.container_page_paragraph>
      These donations helps non-profits to pay salaries. Commercial organisations add these hours in their Corporate Social Responsability reports.
    </.container_page_paragraph>
    <.container_page_paragraph>
      The marketplace timebank keeps track of all work done by non-profits and ensures compliance for all the non-profit reported hours. All reported hours have a clear legal and employment/payroll lineage(ie. KYC, etc.).
    </.container_page_paragraph>
    <.container_page_paragraph>
      Since it's launch in 2024 Burohelp has onboarded 2000+ non-profits and commercial organisations. The Burohelp timebank stores 1M+ worked hours.
    </.container_page_paragraph>
    <.container_page_paragraph>
      Integration and reporting is the most important factors in the operational success of Burohelp.
    </.container_page_paragraph>
  </.container_page_text>
  <.container_page_text title="About the project">
    <.container_page_paragraph>
      The Burohelp platform has been built from ground up as a two sided custom marketplace.
    </.container_page_paragraph>
    <.container_page_paragraph>
      The platform consist of two sides
      <ul>
        <.container_page_paragraph_item icon="hero-minus">
          the non-profit (time bank)
        </.container_page_paragraph_item>
        <.container_page_paragraph_item icon="hero-minus">
          the commercial organisation (donor)
        </.container_page_paragraph_item>
      </ul>
    </.container_page_paragraph>
    <.container_page_paragraph>
      Burohelp brings these two sides together. Non-profits share their hours continously and offer them to all interrested commercial organisations.
    </.container_page_paragraph>
    <.container_page_paragraph>
      Each side has it's custom onboarding & verification process. After onboarding the platform checks the validity of the organisations data in public governmental & commercial databases.
    </.container_page_paragraph>
    <.container_page_paragraph>
      The platform is deployed in AWS (with a fully automated CI/CD) and operates across multiple countries and languages.
    </.container_page_paragraph>
    <.container_page_paragraph>
      All payments processing is executed via Stripe.
    </.container_page_paragraph>
    <.container_page_paragraph>
      Each country has specific local integrations to automate compliance checks and local reporting needs.
    </.container_page_paragraph>
  </.container_page_text>
  
<!--Quote -->
  <.container_page_card
    description="Remote Reason’s tech expertise allowed Burohelp to scale quickly, turning the my vision into a functional platform.
    Paul’s background in AI and localisation ensured the tool could serve global nonprofits without bureaucratic barriers.
    Everything is on schedule and the engagement of Paul and the Remote Reason's team is on the dot all the time."
    image={LinkHelper.image_path("/cases/rael.jpeg")}
    name="Raël Martis Ozuna"
    position="Founder & CEO, Burohelp"
    linkedin="https://www.linkedin.com/in/israel-martis-ozuna/"
    clutch="https://clutch.co/go-to-review/21913110-da3a-48cc-9200-43ae5de59e57/379549"
  />
  <!--Showcase -->
  <div class="container px-6 lg:px-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold leading-normal text-left md:text-4xl">
      What we delivered
    </h1>
  </div>
  <!-- Boxes -->
  <.container_box_large
    alignment="right"
    image="/images/cases/burohelp_onboard.png"
    title="The non-profit side"
  >
    <ul>
      <.container_page_paragraph_item>
        Non-profits can self onboard and provide some basic information about themselves. The plaform validates the data & escalates edge cases to the Burohelo backoffice team.
      </.container_page_paragraph_item>
      <.container_page_paragraph_item>
        Once validated the non-profit can upload timesheets (excel, csv) or connect the Burohelp platform to their Google/Microsoft Calendar or project management tool.
      </.container_page_paragraph_item>
      <.container_page_paragraph_item>
        Once integrated Burohelp keeps retrieving hours and stores them in the time bank for that specific non-profit.
      </.container_page_paragraph_item>
      <.container_page_paragraph_item>
        When donations are received for specific hours the hours are tagged and allocated to the donor. One hour can be sponsored by a single donor.
      </.container_page_paragraph_item>
    </ul>
  </.container_box_large>
  <.container_box_large
    alignment="left"
    image="/images/cases/burohelp_about.png"
    title="The donor side"
  >
    <ul>
      <.container_page_paragraph_item>
        Commercial organisations can self onboard and provide some basic information about themselves. The plaform validates their incorporation information with an integration with the local commercial registry.
      </.container_page_paragraph_item>
      <.container_page_paragraph_item>
        Once validated commercial organisations can search for available projects/hours in the time bank based on various criterias: geo fence, location (ie. country, city, etc.), keywords and others.
      </.container_page_paragraph_item>
      <.container_page_paragraph_item>
        Once the system found the right hours the organisation donates and claim the hours.
      </.container_page_paragraph_item>
      <.container_page_paragraph_item>
        When donations are received for specific hours the hours are tagged and allocated to the donor. One hour can be sponsored by a single donor.
      </.container_page_paragraph_item>
    </ul>
  </.container_box_large>
  <.container_box_large
    alignment="right"
    image="/images/cases/burohelp_onboard.png"
    title="Marketplace backoffice"
  >
    <ul>
      <.container_page_paragraph_item>
        The Burohelp backoffice team has dedicated platform modules that help them validate and monitor the organisations already onboarded on the platform.
      </.container_page_paragraph_item>
      <.container_page_paragraph_item>
        The backoffice emteam can use specific integrations so that they can perform KYC operations fast and with complete audit trails.
      </.container_page_paragraph_item>
      <.container_page_paragraph_item>
        Additionally the platform integrates with external marketing & outreach tools so that the outreach team work benefits from end to end automation (ie. import/export leads, neesletters, etc.)
      </.container_page_paragraph_item>
    </ul>
  </.container_box_large>
  <.container_box_large
    alignment="left"
    image="/images/cases/burohelp_about.png"
    title="Marketing site"
  >
    <ul>
      <.container_page_paragraph_item>
        We wanted to make sure that the sales & marketing team can operate autonomously. As such we bought a Hubspot template, customised it and prepared  a Burohelp specific  marketing site & blog at hub.burohelp.com
      </.container_page_paragraph_item>
      <.container_page_paragraph_item>
        We wanted to make sure that the sales & marketing team can operate autonomously. As such we bought a Hubspot template, customised it and prepared  a Burohelp specific  marketing site & blog at hub.burohelp.com
      </.container_page_paragraph_item>
      <.container_page_paragraph_item>
        This integrates well with other tools used by the team like Intercom, e-mail, slack and others.
      </.container_page_paragraph_item>
    </ul>
  </.container_box_large>
  <!-- Project Highlights  -->
  <.container_page_text title="Setup" />
  <.container_page_box>
    <.page_box_items title="The project">
      <p class="font-semibold">
        Sector: <span class="font-normal">Non-Profits</span>
      </p>
      <p class="font-semibold">Size: <span class="font-normal">xxx </span></p>
      <p class="font-semibold">
        Budget: <span class="font-normal">$50,000 to $199,999 </span>
      </p>
    </.page_box_items>
    <.page_box_items title="Verticals">
      <p>- B2B marketplace</p>
      <p>- Non-profit / Charity</p>
      <p>- CSR Reporting</p>
    </.page_box_items>
    <.page_box_items title="Technologies">
      <p>- Elixir/Phoenix</p>
      <p>- Docker</p>
      <p>- AWS</p>
    </.page_box_items>
  </.container_page_box>
</.layout_page_centered>
